  {
   "id": 11,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "Actions by peak memory",
   "description": "Actions an hour whose most memory used, as NativeLink measured it, fell in each band. NativeLink's buckets go up by four, so the bands are its own. A release build's LTO link uses about 10 GB.",
